<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>FLATLINE Recoil control </Major>
    <Description>Recoil crontrol for flatline.

Recomended settings:

110 FOV
900 DPI
2.53 Sensitivity

test it first,

Enjoy and good luck!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR -3 2
Delay 7 ms
MoveR 3 1
Delay 8 ms
MoveR -3 2
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 1 2
Delay 7 ms
MoveR -1 3
Delay 6 ms
MoveR -3 1
GoWhile 2 13</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>